WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.430
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:06.400
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.630
Starting today, my passionate idol activities,

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:19.670
Aikatsu will surely begin.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.440
Yes! Today's the entrance ceremony!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.950
Starting today, you honeys will be second-year students!

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.940
Are you ready? Yeah!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.720
It's already our second year.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:21.660
The two of us have been at Starlight Academy for six whole months now.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:26.730
The new honeys will have a lot to learn, and they'll surely be feeling helpless.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:32.260
That's where you come in. Each of you will be assigned as a trainer to one new student.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.970
Do everything in your power to show them their new paths.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.970
I'm leaving this new honey to you, Shibuki.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.180
I understand.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:43.040
New students...

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.580
I wonder what kind of girls will come?

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:49.740
At least one of them has caught the media's attention already. {media alright?} {it's fine}

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:50.790
Really?

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.250
I leave this honey in your care,

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.980
Starmiya-senpai.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.590
I'm... a senpai? {figure we might as well keep it going like this} {I have no objections to not translating senpai}

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.110
I'm so happy to have <i>the</i> Shibuki Ran-san as my trainer!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.760
Please take good care of me.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.410
Same here.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.790
The auditorium is this way.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.710
Okay!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.340
I'm not surprised to see Ran so good at this.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.360
Yeah, she's a really reliable person. {not just at times like this}

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.210
There she is! See you later, Ichigo.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.600
S-Sure...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.450
Inagaki-san, good morning.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:36.070
This way.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.840
Let's see...

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:47.160
Looks like she isn't here yet.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.820
This brings back memories.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.790
I remember the first day Aoi and I came like it was yesterday.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.800
Starlight Academy, overflowing with idols.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.000
I never thought I'd end up a student here.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:07.180
I was able to meet my idol, Mizuki-chan... {I think we can double-use idol}

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.840
She's a brightly shining top idol,

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.320
even though she's only one year older than me...

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:15.810
What do I do?!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.890
Back then, Mizuki-chan was a second-year and I, a first...

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:26.910
Does that mean that I have to be the new students' Mizuki-chan?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.250
There's no way...

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.350
It's her.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.670
Kitaouji Sakura-chan!

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:56.670
Sakura!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.740
I hope you know that I haven't accepted this!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.400
Onii-sama, this is my own decision.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.060
E-Excuse me...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:07.140
I'm going to see what kind of place this is with my own two eyes.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.610
We'll speak when I'm finished.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.410
Onii-sama!

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.940
I guess I can wait until after the 
entrance ceremony to talk to her.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.850
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:24.680
It's a big showti—

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.680
We will now begin the Starlight Academy entrance ceremony.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.430
I couldn't talk to my underclassman.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.730
What's she like?

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.610
Kitaouji Sakura? <i>She</i>'s your...

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.200
That girl is—

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.990
Now then, allow me to introduce the person who rocked the world as Hime of the legendary Masquerade.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.940
Headmistress Mitsuishi Orihime will now give a few words.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.140
Girls, congratulations on your acceptance.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:01.040
Thank you very much!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:06.300
You have all surpassed the harsh entrance exams to stand where you are today.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:10.550
Many top idols have started their careers in this academy.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:15.560
Even among last year's new students are those whose buds are starting to bloom in the same way.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:20.310
Whether you'll be able to continue the legacy they have left behind

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.750
depends solely on the effort you put in.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.900
Your idol activities, Aikatsu, will now start.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.650
Yes.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.300
Okay, my new honeys.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:35.660
Allow me to announce a fashion show audition limited to you new students!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:41.440
The winner of this contest will get her picture on the cover of the new student directory.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.570
A fashion show audition.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.710
We've gotta get right to teaching our juniors how to be an idol.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.590
Ah, there she is.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.680
It sure has been a while.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.780
Mizuki-chan?

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:03.920
Mizuki-sama, it has certainly been too long.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.690
Sakura-chan, how's your grandfather doing?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.200
He is doing wonderfully. {What do you think about having Sakura not use conjunctions;}

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.300
That girl's amazing.

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.590
Well she's Kitaouji Sakura-chan, right?

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.910
Oh, so that's her.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:18.730
Kitaouji Sakura-chan.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:20.410
Aoi?!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:25.320
Mizuki-chan had the opportunity to learn traditional Japanese dance from Sakura-chan's grandfather before.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.320
That's how they know each other.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:28.460
From her grandfather?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.230
He's a living national treasure.

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:35.600
Her father and older twin brother are also famous kabuki actors.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.170
And ever since she was young, Sakura-chan

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:43.980
learned traditional dance, and has mastered several other ancient art forms.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.730
She's already a media darling.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.440
Yes, the one and only Kitaouji Sakura-chan!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:58.450
She really does give the impression of a cherry blossom tree, just like her name.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.610
See you later.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.250
Thank you very much.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.430
Kitaouji Sakura-chan!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.330
Yes?

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.810
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:12.470
I've been assigned to be your trainer.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.750
Oh my. My name is Kitaouji Sakura.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:21.480
Ichigo-sama, I humbly ask for your guidance in any matters to come.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.210
Naish to meet you too. {I... guess that's fine}

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.230
What's with that?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.730
Sakura!

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.110
Onii-sama.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.010
Her brother?

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.370
Kitaouji Sakon.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:41.830
The handsome young kabuki actor. He's Sakura-chan's older twin brother.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.120
They sure seem different for being twins.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.700
What is the meaning of this? I heard nothing of you moving into the dorms.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:50.130
I knew you'd object if I told you.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.320
I just spoke with your teachers.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.260
It's ridiculous to consider you moving out of our house to live in a dorm.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:59.000
I've already received approval from Grandfather, Father, and Mother.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.470
<i>I'm</i> the one who knows you the best.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.710
Let's cancel your enrollment and go home.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.890
I will not go with you!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.960
Why do you want to make her quit?

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:12.730
You'll have to excuse me, but this is a problem between siblings.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.630
It has nothing to do with you.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.580
It has everything to do with me! I'm Sakura-chan's trainer.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:20.120
She worked so hard to get in...

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.540
I don't believe that my sister can live by herself.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.540
She needs me!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.920
What's this?

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.070
It's the Kitaouji Theater.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.300
Whenever anyone in my family gets worked up, this phenomenon occurs.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.550
The Kitaouji home must be pretty exciting.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.750
I can recall it clearly as I close my eyes.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:45.800
Always behind me, my fragile younger sister.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.790
Onii-chama, don't ever leave my side, okay?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.910
Don't worry, I'll protect you.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.030
Oh, my sister.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.660
That day's promise remains ever in this breast. {I'd object to "breast" if I didn't remember that Shakespearean plays sometimes used "breast" like this}

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.660
As you can see, Sakura cannot live without me looking after her.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.810
He's such a kind older brother.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:07.920
Sure...

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.190
Onii-sama, that is but a tale from our childhood days.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.330
I am already thirteen years old.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.790
Why did you even decide to become an idol in the first place?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:18.930
That's...

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:25.270
I <i>will</i> become an idol. No matter what you may say, I will definitely not return home.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.340
I understand.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:31.270
If that's how you truly feel, then you are no longer my sister. {harsh}

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.070
What now, Sakura?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.570
I will not return home.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:39.990
I see.

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:43.130
Wait!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.660
Ichigo-sama.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:49.290
Please tell me more about the fashion show audition.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:51.200
But...

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.920
I want to become an idol.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:10:59.290
Okay.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:10.060
Aikatsu, Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.420
Beautiful.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.030
I'm thinking of using this coord for the audition.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.360
What do you think?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.780
It's perfect.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.670
Your school ID and Aikatsu phone.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:28.080
And of course, Aikatsu cards, the life of performers.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:32.590
These three items are like the sacred treasures of Starlight Academy. {she's comparing them to the actual sword, mirror, magatama thing} {sasuga}

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.840
That's an elegant way of putting it.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:40.340
When I first passed the entrance exam and held these in my hands, I felt pure bliss.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.220
So did I.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.730
Ichigo-sama, what was the reason you decided to become an idol?

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.130
I was inspired by Mizuki-chan.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.360
You too?

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.730
Nothing... so you entered this academy?

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.730
Yep. My best friend Aoi came up with the idea.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.940
So that's your reason.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:03.030
Hey, Sakura-chan, isn't there anything you're curious about or don't understand?

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:07.530
Nothing in particular, but thank you for the offer.

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:09.990
I see.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:16.960
Think about what sort of coord you want to wear by tomorrow so we can talk about it.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.090
Yes, I'll be sure to make you proud.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.010
See you again tomorrow.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.890
Yes, I'll take my leave now.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.890
Aoi, whatcha doing?

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.730
I'm trying to think of some advice to give my trainee about what coord to wear.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.020
You're being such a good trainer.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.400
So how are things with Kitaouji Sakura-chan?

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:45.610
She's incredible! Her runway walking and coord choices are way better than mine.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.910
I guess I shouldn't have expected anything less of the jewel of the Kitaouji family.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.120
I wonder if I'm not cut out to be her senpai.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.130
I don't think that's true.

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:56.920
You'll be fine if you just do what you always do.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.990
What I always do?

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:03.230
<i>I wonder what I can do to help Sakura-chan?</i>

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:19.650
The new students fashion show audition is finally tomorrow.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.880
Ichigo-sama, shall we take a breather?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:28.910
Good idea. {seriously, I thought Ichigo's specialty was running} {pretty sure this scene is supposed to illustrate how Sakura is better at actually everything}

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:33.640
I'm sorry to take up your valuable time like this.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.620
I don't mind, but you've really got a lot of stamina, Sakura-chan.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.700
I've been jogging every day since I decided to apply to Starlight Academy.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.800
Every day?

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:42.670
Yes.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:49.680
I've also practiced singing, acting, dancing, and even a little bit of coordinating.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:53.390
Whoa, you're really self-motivated, aren't you.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.400
It's what I've been focused on.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.690
I really wanted to become an idol.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:03.070
I know your brother asked you before, but what made you want to become an idol?

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:04.630
That is...

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.820
The Kitaouji Theater appeared!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:12.220
Allow me to teach the uninformed soul.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.920
On that day, at that hour, on that night.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:20.440
That shining stage was forever embedded deep within mine eyes.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.780
So such a world exists!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:28.270
That yet-unseen brilliance shook my soul and prevented me the relief of sleep.

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:31.000
Such is when I made my heartfelt decision.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:36.850
That I too shall one day become an idol!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.170
That was a great story.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.930
So you look up to Mizuki-chan too.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.350
We're the same.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.750
Yes, that's correct.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:49.550
I can't wait until the fashion show tomorrow.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.620
I bet Kitaouji Sakura-chan's going to win, no problem.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.710
She's the daughter of <i>the</i> Kitaouji family after all.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.290
I wonder what kind of performance she'll put on.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:03.630
Sakura-chan?

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:10.830
Ichigo-sama, I'm going to take my leave to rest in preparation of tomorrow's performance.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.640
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.270
Hoshimiya.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.650
Mizuki-san.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:33.490
Welcome back from your work.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.410
What are you doing out here?

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.630
Sakura-chan seems to be worrying about something.

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.420
But I can't do anything for her...

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:47.170
You really are a good senpai.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.330
But, I...

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:52.780
Even though you've taught me so much,

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.680
even though I want to help her in the same way...

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.640
You <i>are</i> a good senpai. {Look at Mizuki still being a good senpai}

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.970
You're putting all your heart into caring for her.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.770
Sakura-chan sure is blessed.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:11.610
I'm sure that Sakura-chan will be just fine knowing that you'll be by her side.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.830
Just by being there?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:14.530
That's right.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.260
<i>I get it now.</i>

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:21.080
<i>She's been separated from the brother who always looked after her, yet she's still trying her best...</i>

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.650
<i>Then that means...</i>

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.660
Mizuki-san, thank you for the advice.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.050
I have to go now! {look at 'dat parallel development}

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.550
Onii-sama...

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.990
A message from Ichigo-sama?

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.660
"Sakura-chan, look outside"?

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:11.670
Sakura-chan!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.170
Ichigo-sama?

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.060
You're not alone, Sakura-chan!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.950
I'm here for you!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:40.960
And I'm sure that you'll be able to make a ton of new friends.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:44.460
I was able to meet Ran, Otome-chan, and Hikari-chan. {what? Hikari out of nowhere?} {maybe she hangs out with her off-screen}

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:46.570
Shion-chan and Yurika-chan too!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.760
I've met a lot of other wonderful people too!

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.150
You'll be the same!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:57.930
Show me a performance at tomorrow's audition as brilliant as cherry blossoms in full bloom. {hajimete mita // mankai no sakura}

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.470
I'll be there for you!

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:04.370
Yes... I will, Ichigo-sama!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:11.230
Geez, she's sure learned how to use people.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.010
Do you have your student ID?

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:15.990
Yes.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.890
I'll be off now, Ichigo-sama.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:20.050
I'll be watching.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:20.950
Okay!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.690
Congratulations on winning. Your hard work paid off.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.370
It's all thanks to you!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.920
Thank you so much!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.930
Sakura-chan, you were shining like a star! {must insert concetedness}

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.840
I'm a bit disappointed that I wasn't able to win,

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:31.190
but I was so overjoyed just being on that stage!

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:32.430
Sakura.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:35.460
Onii-sama? You came to watch?

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.300
Yeah, Hoshimiya-san called me here.

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.440
She said I definitely had to see you on stage.

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.810
Ichigo-sama...

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:47.450
It would be such a waste if he missed the chance to see how wonderful you were up there.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:51.120
I thought that you wouldn't be able to do anything without me,

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:52.940
but you've really grown.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:58.290
You did well on your own.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.610
No, I wasn't alone.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:06.700
I had a wonderful senpai, Ichigo-sama, by my side.

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:08.550
Sakura-chan...

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:13.900
Ichigo-sama, allow me to continue humbly asking for your guidance

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:16.310
in any matters still to come.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:20.310
Letsh be good friends from now on.

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.820 --> 00:24:01.000
The sakura was truly beautiful back then.

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:04.770
Yeah, and it's even better when you have sakura mochi go to along with it!

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:06.090
Sounds delicious! {I'd eat her sakura, if you know what I mean}{Oh wait, they did that joke with Miku already...}{that reminds me, I still have her salty juices under my bed}

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:07.420
Flower viewing's the best! {reminder to have a note}

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:09.920
A dango for every flower. {see I called it}

00:24:10.790 --> 00:24:12.440
The time's finally come!

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:15.230
It's our chance to challenge Mizuki-san.

00:24:15.230 --> 00:24:17.430
Me too! I'm gonna challenge her!

00:24:17.430 --> 00:24:18.930
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:21.590
Raise the Curtain! Fresh Girls Cup.

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:23.930
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
